# 🎁 AETHERIA — DUNGEON REWARD POOL SYSTEM

> **No EXP.**
>
> Victory does not grant experience.
>
> Victory grants resources, equipment, artifacts, and opportunities.

Reward System menggunakan **RNG System** sebagai dasar pembentukan hadiah.

Reward tidak ditentukan secara tetap.

```text
DUNGEON / EXPLORATION / RAID BOSS
                ↓
          VICTORY RESULT
                ↓
            RNG SYSTEM
                ↓
          REWARD POOL
                ↓
       GAME STATE SYSTEM
                ↓
        VALIDATION RESULT
                ↓
        INVENTORY DATABASE
                ↓
            AI FAIRY
                ↓
             MASTER
```

